    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0341" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg327"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856e.00/9–748: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Consulate General at Batavia</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-09-09T18:00:00-04:00">September 9,
                            1948—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>411. Dept appreciates info Congentel 763 Sep 7 and is deeply concerned Communist
                    threat to present moderate Repub regime. Accordingly if you think desirable, you
                    may your discretion communicate to Hatta following: <list>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                        <item>US Govt will in every practical way assist democratic non-Communist
                            govt of Indonesia successfully to resist Communist tyranny.</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Dept believes stability Hatta regime best assured through acceptance
                            both parties just and practical settlement Dutch-Repub dispute. US now
                            making every effort find basis such settlement. For ConGen info, Dept
                            will back Cochran plan (Gocus
                                366<anchor n="1" xml:id="d243-f1"/> and 367<anchor n="2"
                                xml:id="d243-f2"/> and Usgoc
                                135<anchor n="3" xml:id="d243-f3"/> and will request Neth Emb to
                            secure Hague support. Coordinate, therefore, your representations this
                            point with Cochran.</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Dept will support extension financial help in which all states of
                            peaceful federation Indonesia would share according to their needs and
                            dependent upon their capacity utilize shares of loans efficiently and as
                            sound borrowers. For ConGen info, Cochran requested permission (Gocus 367) to use this language in
                            representations to Repub. Therefore, you should coordinate carefully
                            with Cochran on this point <pb facs="0342" n="328" xml:id="pg328"/>
                            determining with him which of you can most effectively make use of this
                                approach.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d243-f4"/>
                        </item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
